{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301980","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301980","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1830198001:1":{"text":"塞涅唱得是不错，但比起我生前在耀光皇家歌剧院听过的那位艾德琳·沃斯，还是差了点意思。","source_cn":"塞涅唱得是不错，但比起我生前在耀光皇家歌剧院听过的那位...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79DD4948F78C57A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830198002:1":{"text":"那位的高音，才叫真正的穿透灵魂——当然，精神层面上的。","source_cn":"那位的高音，才叫真正的穿透灵魂——当然，精神层面上的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47D335A1EC6873B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830198003:1":{"text":"你又拿艾德琳说事。她都是多少个世纪前的人物了，现在的孩子能唱成这样已经很了不起了。","source_cn":"你又拿艾德琳说事。她都是多少个世纪前的人物了，现在的孩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7320E89AFBBFA58D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830198004:1":{"text":"所以我只是说“不如”，又没说她不好。","source_cn":"所以我只是说“不如”，又没说她不好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B2DDD77B2B32271","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830198005:1":{"text":"走吧，请你喝酒，算是感谢你留的座。","source_cn":"走吧，请你喝酒，算是感谢你留的座。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x212C286AB7986809","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"",